  "description": "PESTUF crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n m c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H100 Al2 O28 Tb3 1-,C6 H16 N1 1+,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.946-3.962 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.75-109.62°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C56H118Al2NTb3O29.",
